{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fawn the Florist is a <strong>cozy idle game</strong> that sits at the bottom of your screen, creating a peaceful companion for you as you work, study, or relax. In this game, your goal is to nurture a beautiful garden and attract a cast of friendly critter companions. As you cultivate new flowers and expand your thriving garden, your desktop will bloom with vibrant life and colour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content within the Demo includes; 8 unlock-able flowers, 3 automation critters, beginning tutorial, levelling and quest systems.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034370/extras/5f0d68eabeb8028d9d82789f2eb15f37.poster.avif?t=1759986108\" width=1170 height=301 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034370/extras/5f0d68eabeb8028d9d82789f2eb15f37.webm?t=1759986108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock New Flowers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the scorching fire of the Volcanic Zinnias to the calming droplets of the Hydrogenas, discover all the beautiful flowers along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034370/extras/5dfd6ab605742f3aea08fa37dc3db6bd.avif?t=1759986108\" data-has-big width=1560 height=321 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enlist the Help of your Critter Companions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By building homes and providing care, you can befriend a cast of critter companions. In return for your love, they'll help you maintain your garden while you're busy or relaxing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034370/extras/910950dfc1900e9d5c5dad8145b21bb5.avif?t=1759986108\" data-has-big width=1560 height=321 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete Quests for Fawn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on simple tasks for Fawn and breathe new life into her gardens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034370/extras/f335732dbe3e0db84b9c46b476646d3b.avif?t=1759986108\" data-has-big width=1560 height=321 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Position the Game to your Needs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the resolution position of your game to fit your purpose and needs to comfortably grow your garden from your desktop!\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034370?t=1759986108","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034370?t=1759986108","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034370/556225f7fd846793b699dec2bcbf76d6a59525fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759986108","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034370/556225f7fd846793b699dec2bcbf76d6a59525fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759986108","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fawn the Florist is a <strong>cozy idle game</strong> that sits at the bottom of your screen, creating a peaceful companion for you as you work, study, or relax. In this game, your goal is to nurture a beautiful garden and attract a cast of friendly critter companions. As you cultivate new flowers and expand your thriving garden, your desktop will bloom with vibrant life and colour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content within the Demo includes; 8 unlock-able flowers, 3 automation critters, beginning tutorial, levelling and quest systems.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034370/extras/5f0d68eabeb8028d9d82789f2eb15f37.poster.avif?t=1759986108\" width=1170 height=301 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034370/extras/5f0d68eabeb8028d9d82789f2eb15f37.webm?t=1759986108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock New Flowers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the scorching fire of the Volcanic Zinnias to the calming droplets of the Hydrogenas, discover all the beautiful flowers along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034370/extras/5dfd6ab605742f3aea08fa37dc3db6bd.avif?t=1759986108\" data-has-big width=1560 height=321 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enlist the Help of your Critter Companions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By building homes and providing care, you can befriend a cast of critter companions. In return for your love, they'll help you maintain your garden while you're busy or relaxing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034370/extras/910950dfc1900e9d5c5dad8145b21bb5.avif?t=1759986108\" data-has-big width=1560 height=321 /><